# Call plan of sw48: what the NMS's scheduled loops send this device.
#
# device:   CRS354-48G-4S+2Q+, RouterOS 7.24.5, class C1, role switch (personality switch48_clean)
# scenario: the NMS starts with this device in a known fleet of 5 and polls it for one hour:
#           default settings, nominal cadences (no jitter), a command takes no time
#
# A change in this file is a change in what a device of this kind is sent.
# Rewrite it with: go test ./internal/poller -run TestCallPlan -update

commands in the hour     271
  average per minute     4.52
  most in one minute     24 (minute 0)
  most after start-up    17 (minute 15; start-up is minutes 0-1)
reply rows in the hour   5815
liveness dials           120 (a TCP connect to the API port, no command)

